  "reasoning": "The defendant established multiple companies and, under the guise of various investment projects, solicited funds from the public by promising high returns. The funds were not used for the stated projects and could not be returned. This conduct fits the statutory definition of illegal public fundraising (非法集资罪), which is distinct from simple fraud or illegal acceptance of deposits. No other distinct offenses are evident from the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]非法集资<eoa>"
}
